# WHAT YOU BUILD IS NOTICED (SETTLE.md S2; Interference `built`, StructureKind
# .loudness). The reads app's interference trace before a holding goes up, and
# again after a hearth, a turret and a solar array: the region watched it happen,
# and the found tech most of all.
#   tools/tour.sh tours/built_noticed.tour --seed=1 --hour=10 --weather=clear:0 \
#     --give=stone:6,deadwood:6,timber:4,scrap:16,copper:6,iron:2,rep_light:2,wick:4
coast calm
place spawn
wait 0.4
walk -1,1 1.5
wait 0.5
tap pause
await app:pause 3
choose reads
tap use
await app:reads 3
wait 0.6
shot 01-the-region-before-anything-went-up with app:reads
tap pause
await app:pause 3
tap pause
await app:none 3
tap holding
await app:holding 4
choose build_hearth
tap use
await made 6
wait 0.4
choose build_turret
tap use
await made 6
wait 0.4
choose build_solar_array
tap use
await made 6
wait 0.4
shot 01b-the-holding-put-up with app:holding
tap pause
await app:none 3
tap pause
await app:pause 3
choose reads
tap use
await app:reads 3
wait 0.6
shot 02-and-after-a-turret-and-an-array-went-up with app:reads
